OL,3,GNEWSASnooker champion Graeme Dott
OL,4,Ajailed for seven years for child sex
OL,5,Aabuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer world snooker champion Graeme
OL,8,FDott has been jailed for seven years
OL,9,Fafter being convicted of child sexual
OL,10,Fabuse.
OL,12,FJudge Lord Harrower said Dott robbed
OL,13,Fhis victims of "a significant part of
OL,14,Ftheir childhood" and said his behaviour
OL,15,Fbore the hallmarks of grooming.
OL,17,FDott had denied two charges of lewd and
OL,18,Flibidinous behaviour towards a girl and
OL,19,Fa boy between 1993 and 2010 but was
OL,20,Ffound guilty following a trial at the
OL,21,FHigh Court in Glasgow.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
