OL,3,GNEWSASnooker champion Graeme Dott
OL,4,Ajailed for seven years for child sex
OL,5,Aabuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 49-year-old Scot, who won the world
OL,8,Fsnooker title in 2006, showed no
OL,9,Femotion as he was sentenced, only
OL,10,Fnodding to someone in the public
OL,11,Fgallery as he was led away.
